{58}{Well, I can't as how you won't have the bloody time to do so, friend!  This place...time is all you got!  'Course, I spend most a' mine killin' things...whether it's nasty creatures or nosy inmates.  [He gives you a hard look.]  It makes no difference to me, as long as I get left alone...}{Well, I can't as how you won't have the bloody time to do so, friend!  This place...time is all you got!  'Course, I spend most a' mine killin' things...whether it's nasty creatures or nosy inmates.  [He gives you a hard look.]  It makes no difference to me, as long as I get left alone...}{}{}{}{}
