{130}{I was adventuring in the Vendigroth Wastes with my old gang...a bunch of the most rough'n tumble dogs you ever came across.  While we were in the Wastes, we came across the ruins of an old, old city.  And big, bigger than anything I've ever seen...it went on for miles.  And it wasn't on any of the maps...}{I was adventuring in the Vendigroth Wastes with my old gang...a bunch of the most rough'n tumble dogs you ever came across.  While we were in the Wastes, we came across the ruins of an old, old city.  And big, bigger than anything I've ever seen...it went on for miles.  And it wasn't on any of the maps...}{}{}{}{}
{131}{So?  What happened?}{}{5}{}{134}{}
{132}{Uh...}{}{-4}{}{134}{}
{134}{Beneath the city there were endless tunnels and caverns...a entire city all by itself.  And we went deep, deeper than any dungeon I've ever been in.  And then, after we saw it, they started to come out...[He shudders.]}{Beneath the city there were endless tunnels and caverns...a entire city all by itself.  And we went deep, deeper than any dungeon I've ever been in.  And then, after we saw it, they started to come out...[He shudders.]}{}{}{}{}
