{149}{After that, I was never the same, boy.  I mean, I was always a little unbalanced up here, [He points to his head.] but after that, I just went on a bloody rampage.  Ended up in a scuff with four Dernholm soldiers one night in a tavern, and three of 'em wound up dead.  Old King Praetor had me thrown in the Pits a few days later...}{After that, I was never the same, girl.  I mean, I was always a little unbalanced up here, [He points to his head.] but after that, I just went on a bloody rampage.  Ended up in a scuff with four Dernholm soldiers one night in a tavern, and three of 'em wound up dead.  Old King Praetor had me thrown in the Pits a few days later...}{}{}{}{}
