{500}{Well, I can honestly your about the most useless individual I've ever met.  What does a thief know about Caladon?  It's like askin' what a fish knows about water!  Lots of old money here in Caladon, as well as the Royal Palace...a thief's paradise, if you know what you're about.  And most obviously you don't...}{Well, I can honestly your about the most useless individual I've ever met.  What does a thief know about Caladon?  It's like askin' what a fish knows about water!  Lots of old money here in Caladon, as well as the Royal Palace...a thief's paradise, if you know what you're about.  And most obviously you don't...}{}{}{}{}
