{504}{What?  What do I know about this place?  I been locked up here for the last 10 years!  Dernholm ain't got much, but it's got the Pits and it's got King Praetor.  Those two are enough for me...let's get the hell out of here...}{What?  What do I know about this place?  I been locked up here for the last 10 years!  Dernholm ain't got much, but it's got the Pits and it's got King Praetor.  Those two are enough for me...let's get the hell out of here...}{}{}{}{}
